# Replay script for stream_replay_t.tas.
# R2R format (simulator-defined pending a spec ruling; see the R2R README
# "Scripted streaming-register replay"):
#   <stream-index> <at-count> <value>
# stream N returns <value> for reads at/after retired-instruction count
# <at-count>, until the next entry for that stream. Only stream0..stream2
# (0..2) are scriptable; unscripted streams read 0.
0 0 111
0 100 222
1 0 333
